CONTENT PROVENANCE (CONTENT ≠ SOURCE):
  SOURCE_MATERIAL (author's originals/copies, not AI):
    - docs/NOTARIUS_FULL_SESSION.md       (uploaded by the author; AI added AD notes)
    - docs/foundation_layer/**            (COPY of the MSL/MIP Foundation Layer package)
    - docs/e_continuity/**                (COPY of the E-Continuity v2.3 package)
