BOUNDARIES (parent rules honored):
  COPY ≠ PROVENANCE
  RECONSTRUCTION ≠ PHYSICAL_ORIGINAL
  HASH_EXISTS ≠ HASH_VERIFIED
  LLM_OUTPUT ≠ VERIFIED_COPY
  INTERFACE_STATE ≠ RECOVERABILITY_STATE

